      "context": "Desktop web selector · 280 × 280 px. Compact square popover with the same 16 px corners, soft depth, grey well, and translucent selected pill as the current web navbar. The small Find field keeps immediate numeric filtering. Selecting a number navigates and closes; Escape, an outside click, or the active navbar trigger dismisses. Long indexes scroll inside the square. No preview, helper footer, repeated book label, or extra close control.",
